# Nothing is needed for the web app: it talks to the Worker it is served from
# (client/worker/), on the same origin. See client/README.md for `wrangler dev`.
#
# A native build has no origin to ask, so it would need the Worker's address —
# but Cloudflare Access, the sign-in, has no native path yet, so this is here
# for when it does. It is PUBLIC (EXPO_PUBLIC_ means it ships in the app).
#
# No database URL, password or key ever goes in this file or anywhere in
# client/: the Worker holds the only credential, inside its Hyperdrive config.

# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://business-japanese-test-practice.<you>.workers.dev
